      "message": "test: Add private-then-public broadcast test via wallet resend\n\nExtend p2p_private_broadcast_then_public.py with a second case (if the\nwallet is compiled): a wallet transaction is sent via private broadcast,\ncomes back from the network into the mempool and the wallet of the\noriginator, and is then announced to all peers by the periodic resend\nof the wallet.",
      "committer": {
